Subject: Update Jackson 2.22.0 to 2.22.2 for CVE remediation
Origin: DHI-internal CVE remediation
Reference: https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2/com/fasterxml/jackson/core/jackson-databind/2.22.2/
Description: Gradle 9.8.x pins Jackson 2.22.0 through shared dependency-management
  versions. Bump the 2.22 line to 2.22.2, which fixes CVE-2026-54512 through
  CVE-2026-54515, CVE-2026-59889, CVE-2026-68497, CVE-2026-83557,
  CVE-2026-19032, and GHSA-mhm7-754m-9p8w without crossing a major or minor
  Jackson version.

diff --git a/gradle/dependency-management/shared-versions.properties b/gradle/dependency-management/shared-versions.properties
index c44c5e9d..0184902a 100644
--- a/gradle/dependency-management/shared-versions.properties
+++ b/gradle/dependency-management/shared-versions.properties
@@ -21,7 +21,7 @@ errorProne=2.50.0!!
 # When bumping Groovy, add a row to the embedded Groovy table in
 # platforms/documentation/docs/src/docs/userguide/releases/compatibility.adoc
 groovy=4.0.33!!
-jackson=2.22.0!!
+jackson=2.22.2!!
 kotlinCoroutines=1.10.2!!
 maven=3.9.5!!
 mavenResolver=1.9.16!!
